;FAKE passage, roughly estimated as per sump in Northern Caves index.
;Added to tie master cave into surface in roughly correct location
;Added by NS 22.03.2019

*begin FAKE_gingling_sump
*export 1 2

*DATE 2024.04.1			;This data is reconstructed and is assumed to be grid north and does not contain a date.
						;the calibrate compass command compensates for the auto adjusted declination of +0.23 degrees
*CALIBRATE compass -0.23;so the *AUTO DECLINATION command should not affect this data.
						;<<< Simon Cornhill 2026.07.31 >>>

;from	to	tape	compass	clino
*flags duplicate
1	2	75	220	0

*end FAKE_gingling_sump